<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Retrieves the corresponding graph from a group of graphs :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`
:raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

.. note::
   ``nullptr`` is the &quot;not found&quot; answer, following
   :cpp:func:`IniSectionGraph::getSection`&apos;s found-or-``nullptr``-or-throw
   convention
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>graphGroups</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
